        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-degree-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Exclaim about degree with 多 and 好",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "多 and 好 before an adjective can express admiration or strong feeling. In this use they do not ask for a measurement or mean good as a separate quality.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这里多好！",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ duō hǎo ！",
                "meaning": "How lovely it is here!",
                "audio": "421236a1e92113c449eec3ef3c30263289f3a87cc407635be30a65d3e1b23a47"
              },
              {
                "text": "今天好热！",
                "pinyin": "jīntiān hǎo rè ！",
